                                "sense_id": "851c46de-aff7-31ae-abd9-7c60f7317492",
                                "text": "говори́ть восто́рженно о ко́м-либо",
                                "translation": "to speak enthusiastically (with admiration) about someone; go into raptures about someone",
                                "english": "to speak enthusiastically (with admiration) about someone; go into raptures about someone"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "55f76a45-3d0d-4f44-9b64-7a30e531f30f",
                                "sense_id": "851c46de-aff7-31ae-abd9-7c60f7317492",
                                "text": "— Ну, как живёшь, друг? — спросил толстый, восторженно глядя на друга. — Служишь где? Дослужился?",
                                "translation": "\"Well, how are you doing my friend?\" the fat man asked, looking enthusiastically at his friend. \"Are you in the service? What grade have you reached?\"",
                                "english": "\"Well, how are you doing my friend?\" the fat man asked, looking enthusiastically at his friend. \"Are you in the service? What grade have you reached?\""
                            }
